flowchart TB
  failure["Unexpected application failure"]
  handler["Apply shared error handling contract"]
  public["Return minimal generic client response"]
  context["Select useful diagnostic context"]
  minimize["Exclude secrets and unnecessary personal data"]
  protect["Restrict access and apply retention policy"]
  failure --> handler
  handler -->|Public response| public
  handler -->|Internal evidence| context
  context --> minimize
  minimize --> protect
